N('winding-monotone-backward-heat','identity','Winding monotonicity under the de Bruijn flow (classical orientation)','H_t(x)=int e^{tu^2}Phi(u)cos(xu)du satisfies dH/dt=-d^2H/dx^2; the Gaussian convolution proxy is the exact flow at negative time. Winding count is monotone by de Bruijn Thm 13 plus a jet lemma. Ceiling: the Polymath15 0.2 architecture.','proved','no','no',P('Imp34825WindingCountLadderViz')+' '+P('VizWindingDysonFlowPage'),['heat-flow','lambda','vortex'])
