N('route-h-self-product-obstruction','obstruction','Weil-Deligne template over Z: tensor-power trick gives no reduction','The tensor-power trick uses only the abscissa of absolute convergence of the Euler product. Zeta-regularization (Kurokawa zeta tensor zeta, zeros rho_1+rho_2) extends the function but not the zero-free region: it buys a functional equation, not positivity. Hodge-index needs Spec Z x Spec Z.','closed','yes','yes',P('RhNovelRoutesRoadmapPage')+' src/data/rh-routes-jkl-non-statmech-external-input-hunt-2026-09-23.js',['function-field','hodge','euler-product','antibridge'])
N('route-j-fejer-floor','identity','Route J: Fejer zero-free-region floor R=5.8284','Pure Fejer scheme: a_1/a_0=2cos(pi/(n+2)), c_ceil=2(1-(a_1/a_0)^{-1/2})^2, R_floor=1/c_ceil decreasing to 1/(2(1-1/sqrt2)^2)=5.8284. Classical 3-4-1 gives 34.82; Mossinghoff-Trudgian Stechkin weighting gives 5.573412. No external input beyond de la Vallee Poussin. Map row P25.','proved','no','yes',P('Imp96058FejerCeilingFloorLadderViz')+' '+P('Imp95624MtyVsVkCrossoverViz'),['zero-free','explicit-formula'])
