N('route-m-vasyunin-burnol','measured-phenomenon','Route M: Vasyunin-Gram Nyman-Beurling ladder sits on the Burnol floor','d_N^2 log N/sum_rho 1/|rho|^2 goes from 1.258 (N=5) to 0.998 (N=500). |1+zeta D_N|^2/(1/4+t^2) equals 1 at every zero and has median 0.079, max 0.692 between zeros. Route collapses to the mollifier lineage; conditioning ceilings T<F<M.','measured','yes','no',P('Imp96075RouteMVasyuninDnLadderViz')+' '+P('Imp96120RouteMBurnolRatioDenseLadderViz')+' '+P('Imp96741RouteMThreeCeilingDecompositionViz'),['mollifier','euler-product'])
