N('route-i-semilocal-trace-remainder','identity','Route I: semilocal Sonine trace identity and its remainder','Tr(theta(f)P Phat_S P)=W_inf+W_2+D_S exactly; delta_S(rho) has log spikes at rho=2^k+eps: 12.1465, 16.6511, 22.7132, 31.6996 at eps=1e-7 (law (2^{k/2}/2)log_2(1/eps)) versus 0.379224 at rho=3. Weil positivity below ln 3 iff D_S<=L_S.','proved','yes','no',P('Imp96103RouteIRemainderResonanceViz'),['weil','trace-formula','explicit-formula'])
N('route-i-cusp-allocation','measured-phenomenon','Route I: fixed-fraction cusp allocation f_out(rho)=1-1/rho','At S-unit cusps rho=2^a 3^b of the {inf,2,3} remainder, the fraction of the (log^2) cusp landing in the Sonine excess tends to 1-1/rho, generalizing the p=2 half-cusp law. E_S composed with Q is unbounded along p=2 resonances for every 2a>ln 2. Map row P19.','measured','yes','no',P('Imp96136RouteIFixedFractionPanelViz'),['weil','trace-formula','antibridge'])
